[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16624.47, "timestamp": "04:37:04", "text": "青いもの。 なぜすべてが青いのか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16626.709, "timestamp": "04:37:06", "text": "こんにちは。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16629.089, "timestamp": "04:37:09", "text": "ああ、大変だ。 こんにちは。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16635.15, "timestamp": "04:37:15", "text": "どうだい、坊や？ 元気かい？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16638.629, "timestamp": "04:37:18", "text": "あなたのキャラクターを作成中です。 ええ、まだここにいますよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16641.109, "timestamp": "04:37:21", "text": "。   ちくしょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16649.269, "timestamp": "04:37:29", "text": "どれが有効なのか、とても混乱しました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16653.349, "timestamp": "04:37:33", "text": "サーバーをレンタルできます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16655.83, "timestamp": "04:37:35", "text": "はぁ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16659.269, "timestamp": "04:37:39", "text": "このゲームではサーバーをレンタルすることができます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16662.789, "timestamp": "04:37:42", "text": "え、本当に？ いくら？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16667.74, "timestamp": "04:37:47", "text": "H."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16674.789, "timestamp": "04:37:54", "text": "君ならできると思うよ。 このゲームは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16677.67, "timestamp": "04:37:57", "text": "配信しやすいと思う。 ええ、そうみたいですね"}]